 INPUT CARD>! chloroacetaldehyde IRC run (caa005bTSaIRCb.inp), adjusted only for            
 INPUT CARD>! direction (FORWRD=.t. here; that reference file was FORWRD=.f.,               
 INPUT CARD>! i.e. backward).                                                               
 INPUT CARD>!                                                                               
 INPUT CARD>! One deliberate change from the historical reference: $FORCE uses              
 INPUT CARD>! PURIFY=.t. here rather than PROJCT=.t. The aa001c/aa001d work                 
 INPUT CARD>! established directly (via docs-input.txt) that PURIFY is the correct          
 INPUT CARD>! $FORCE-level keyword for cleaning up translation/rotation contamination       
 INPUT CARD>! when a $ZMAT is in use (PROJCT is $STATPT's own, Cartesian-specific           
 INPUT CARD>! keyword, not $FORCE's) -- the historical reference file may have              
 INPUT CARD>! carried this same unnoticed issue, since it wasn't the focus of that          
 INPUT CARD>! run. Whether $FORCE is even substantively invoked during RUNTYP=IRC is        
 INPUT CARD>! not fully certain either way; kept for consistency with the working           
 INPUT CARD>! reference file's structure.                                                   
 INPUT CARD>                                                                                
 INPUT CARD> $BASIS GBASIS=N21 NGAUSS=6 NDFUNC=1 NPFUNC=1 DIFFSP=.t. $END                   
 INPUT CARD> $CONTRL SCFTYP=RHF RUNTYP=IRC NZVAR=33 $END                                    
 INPUT CARD> $CONTRL DFTTYP=wB97X-D $END                                                    
 INPUT CARD> $IRC saddle=.t. tsengy=.t. forwrd=.t. $END                                     
 INPUT CARD> $IRC npoint=200 stride=0.1 opttol=0.00005 $END                                 
 INPUT CARD> $SCF DIIS=.t. DAMP=.t. $END                                                    
 INPUT CARD> $ZMAT DLC=.t. AUTO=.t. $END                                                    
 INPUT CARD> $ZMAT NONVDW(1)=8,13, 10,7, 7,3, 8,10 $END                                     
 INPUT CARD> $FORCE METHOD=SEMINUM PURIFY=.t. $END                                          
 INPUT CARD> $PCM SOLVNT=WATER $END                                                         
